	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `o` followed by part of a note filename, then press Return to open it in Obsidian. Choose **Vault folder** in Configure Workflow. Results show their vault-relative paths to distinguish duplicate names. This uses the macOS Spotlight index for filenames and the Markdown content type; it does not read note contents or search aliases, headings, or full text. If a note is missing, check iCloud availability and Alfred File Search Troubleshooting.</string>
